 this!"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"ஓரான்","parts":[{"text":"ஓர்","lemma":"ōr","gloss":"one"},{"text":"ஆன்","lemma":"āṉ","gloss":"cow"}],"gloss":"of a single cow"},{"surface":"வல்சி","parts":[{"text":"வல்சி","lemma":"valci","gloss":"food"}],"gloss":"food"},{"surface":"சீரில்","parts":[{"text":"சீர்","lemma":"cīr","gloss":"prosperity"},{"text":"இல்","lemma":"il","gloss":"without"}],"gloss":"without prosperity"},{"surface":"வாழ்க்கை","parts":[{"text":"வாழ்க்கை","lemma":"vāḻkkai","gloss":"life"}],"gloss":"life"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"பெருநலக்","parts":[{"text":"பெருநலக்","lemma":"பெருநலக்","gloss":"of great beauty"}],"gloss":"of great beauty","split_unverified":true},{"surface":"குறுமகள்","parts":[{"text":"குறுமை","lemma":"kuṟumai","gloss":"young"},{"text":"மகள்","lemma":"makaḷ","gloss":"girl"}],"gloss":"young girl"},{"surface":"வந்தென","parts":[{"text":"வந்து","lemma":"vantu","gloss":"having come"},{"text":"என","lemma":"eṉa","gloss":"because"}],"gloss":"because she came"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"இனிவிழ","parts":[{"text":"இனிவிழ","lemma":"இனிவிழ","gloss":"now a festival"}],"gloss":"now a festival","split_unverified":true},{"surface":"வாயிற்று","parts":[{"text":"வாயிற்று","lemma":"வாயிற்று","gloss":"has become"}],"gloss":"has become","split_unverified":true},{"surface":"என்னுமிவ்","parts":[{"text":"என்னுமிவ்","lemma":"என்னுமிவ்","gloss":"saying, this"}],"gloss":"saying, this","split_unverified":true},{"surface":"வூரே","parts":[{"text":"வூரே","lemma":"வூரே","gloss":"town indeed"}],"gloss":"town indeed","split_unverified":true}]}],"literal":"Wearing, stringing, putting on, and tucking in / crowded with the group of companions shining in leafy ornaments, / you come with the festival, you indeed! Look at this: / 'The life without prosperity, with food from a single cow, / because the young girl of great beauty came, / has now become a festival,' says this town!","translation":"Wearing leaf-garments, stringing garlands, putting on ornaments, and tucking flowers in your hair, you return in festive mood, crowded among companions who shine in leafy attire. But look at this! This town says: 'Ever since the young girl of great beauty arrived, this poor household, which once subsisted on the milk of a single cow, has turned into a place of constant festival!'","modern":"இலை ஆடைகளை உடுத்தியும், மாலைகளைத் தொடுத்தும், அணிகலன்களைப் பூண்டும், மலர்களைச் செருகியும், தழையணிகளால் பொலிவு பெற்ற தோழர்களோடு கூடி, நீ விழாக் கோலத்துடன் வருகிறாய். ஆனால் இதோ பார்! 'ஒரே ஒரு பசுவின் பாலை உணவாகக் கொண்டு வறுமையில் கழிந்த வாழ்க்கை, பேரழகுடைய இந்த இளமகள் வந்ததால், இனி எப்போதும் திருவிழாவாக மாறிவிட்டது' என்று இந்த ஊரே பேசுகிறது.","explanation":"This poem is set in the Marutham (agricultural) landscape, where the theme of infidelity and the hero's return from the courtesan's quarters is central. The speaker is the heroine's friend (thōḻi), addressing the hero who has returned home dressed in festive garments after celebrating with courtesans. She contrasts his superficial, external celebration with the true, domestic prosperity brought by the heroine. The friend points out that before the heroine's arrival, the hero's household was poor, subsisting on the yield of a single cow. However, the heroine's virtue, grace, and domestic management have transformed his humble home into a place of permanent joy and abundance, as praised by the entire town. By highlighting this, the friend gently shames the hero for neglecting such a precious wife to pursue fleeting pleasures elsewhere.","model":"gemini-3.5-flash"}}